{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"The current phase permits model proposals and source checks; training runs automatically after submission. The existing results show that counts and learned history summaries work better together: removing either reduces validation AUC by about 0.004.\n\nI’ll test whether explicit match counts allow a simpler history summary. Matched controls will separate uniform pooling from learned event weighting and target-dependent weighting."}}
